[{"title":"蜀道难","author":"杨士奇","text":"蜀山峨峨连剑阁，百丈飞崖俯奔壑。\n逶迤鸟道出云中，江横石栈凌虚空。\n行人未行先胆落，马足凌竞度还却。\n由来此路险莫当，王遵策驭如康庄。\n未若人心有崎曲，眼前十步能摧毂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1945,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜长","author":"杨士奇","text":"月明星稀河汉凉，高秋蟋蟀鸣洞房。\n愁人不寐独彷徨，披衣徐步出东厢。\n白露如玉兰委芳，感激涕泪纷纵横。\n为君含思思断肠，念君迢遥异他乡。\n欲往从之河无梁，夜长悠悠夜未央。\n援琴弹丝写哀伤，山川万里永相望，我独与尔为参商。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1946,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将进酒","author":"杨士奇","text":"将进酒，酒满瓯。\n华馔肆陈，炰羔炙牛。\n将进酒，酒满觞。\n高怀雅度，众宾在堂。\n将进酒，勿蹉跎。\n奉君寿，为君歌。\n白日西逝，黄河东驰。\n人生几时。\n将进酒，青天翳云，沧海扬波。\n人生奈何。\n将进酒，晴光摇荡二月时，紫花葳蕤黄柳垂。\n花前百鸟春乱啼，玉颜雪皎扬素眉。\n清歌宛转舞逶迤。\n将进酒，君莫辞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1947,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"君马黄","author":"杨士奇","text":"君马黄，我马白。\n并出青楼东，俱驰绿杨陌。\n陌头春日游人多，复恐红尘暗玉珂。\n长安大道净如洗，回辔联翩若流水。\n一双意气逼青春，共指天门五云里。\n男儿高步会成名，何须一日千里行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1948,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"紫骝马","author":"杨士奇","text":"紫骝马，黄金鞯。\n五花错落锦连钱。\n三鬃剪出鸣向天，红丝饰鞚珊瑚鞭。\n扬鞭揽辔殊慨然。\n愿得出身事明主，驰马挥刀奋威武。\n一为除凶报千古。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1949,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行路难","author":"杨士奇","text":"行路难，路多岐。\n青天白日光洞地，出门相背东西驰。\n忆昔贫贱时，两情如胶漆。\n共言生死不相违，握手披肝誓天日。\n君今得意成大勋，金章封侯蒙主恩。\n六曹贵臣却避马，两府官僚趋过门。\n一朝富贵谁能及，翻笑傍人百忧集。\n平生金石安足论，对面云泥不相揖。\n世事悠悠安可期，芳春花木秋易衰。\n冰霜岁寒不改色，却羡南山松柏枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1950,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陌上桑","author":"杨士奇","text":"陌上桑。\n柔条未全劲，碧叶纷低昂。\n秦家女儿年十五，朝日成妆把筐筥。\n把筐筥，盈盈南陌前。\n明珠结宝带，翡翠贴花钿，一身皎皎尽成妍。\n使君从南来，顾盼久徘徊。\n遥见东方骑，惆怅空乘五马回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1951,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关山月","author":"杨士奇","text":"关山月，皎洁如清霜。\n连营接幕夕流光。\n流光犹得照故园，征人见月徒伤魂。\n四时弦望如流去，可惜韶华暗中度。\n深闺少年两别离，还如婵娟缺半规。\n缺半规，三五来复圆，一身远戍何时旋？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1952,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"结客少年场行","author":"杨士奇","text":"置酒高堂上，嘉殽列肥鲜。\n结交并豪侠，四座皆少年。\n意气不复殊，肝胆相披宣。\n仰视白日辉，一言誓青天。\n贻我紫绮裘，报君珊瑚钩。\n暮从邯郸饮，朝入洛城游。\n横行无七贵，傲睨凌五侯。\n腰间双青龙，精光含九秋。\n投躯报知己，慷慨当仇雠。\n性命如鸿毛，夕死无怨尤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1953,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从军行六章 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"少小从六军，英声振三边。\n拓疆有勋业，貂蝉二十年。\n遭遇亨嘉辰，万里净烽烟。\n顾视双宝刀，精光犹彻天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1954,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从军行六章 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"宝刀白昼鸣，旄头出西陲。\n平明有诏书，遴选行率师。\n甲士百万馀，桓桓各如貔。\n慷慨出门去，妻子安足辞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1955,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从军行六章 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"出门意气都，上马跨雕鞍。\n旌旗亘千里，戈矛霜雪寒。\n来苏望苦深，遄驱敢辞难。\n经过令严肃，鸡狗亦得安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1956,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从军行六章 其四","author":"杨士奇","text":"令严岂不惜，军动良苦辛。\n冰行屡及暮，露坐恒达晨。\n所倚主将明，抚养义且仁。\n恩威两无遗，谁不思奋身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1957,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从军行六章 其五","author":"杨士奇","text":"奋身一何勇，压敌三重围。\n师行倚大义，奇谋定足希。\n所向势莫当，降者日以归。\n杀之昧天道，纵之表皇威。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1958,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从军行六章 其六","author":"杨士奇","text":"皇威既清肃，奏凯发回军。\n明旦谒金门，饮至劳殊勋。\n赏赉过百千，麾下歘见分。\n拜稽谢万乘，归钓清江濆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1959,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨雪曲","author":"杨士奇","text":"边城九月尽，雨雪正霏霏。\n兼霰侵毡幕，如冰晃铁衣。\n塞垣深莫辨，边云冷不飞。\n鬓毛分可拟，征戍几时归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1960,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上之回","author":"杨士奇","text":"传警甘泉外，扬銮载道周。\n回中戒巡省，云动赴遐陬。\n春色承雕辇，山光影翠旒。\n吾皇亿万岁，岁岁总来游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1961,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芳树曲","author":"杨士奇","text":"阳和二月时，列树发葳蕤。\n凝辉映绮阁，飘香度锦帷。\n蝶戏栖浮蕊，莺响隐高枝。\n芳华今若此，千春亦不移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1962,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"折杨柳","author":"杨士奇","text":"双堤夹道傍，垂柳复垂杨。\n攀条知色改，缀絮讶丝长。\n思妇悲迟暮，征夫望故乡。\n一闻清角起，谁不泪沾裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1963,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自君之出矣 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"自君之出矣，闻道戍凉州。\n思君如明月，夜夜向西流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1964,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自君之出矣 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"自君之出矣，镜台尘网生。\n思君如海水，浩荡何时平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1965,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵陆伯阳林塘晚咏兼简雷道夫 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"金门趋讲罢，西园日暮时。\n繁阴交杂树，轻浪散清池。\n玩芳因坐久，延月却归迟。\n还与同袍侣，携手咏新诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1966,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵陆伯阳林塘晚咏兼简雷道夫 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"高居傍城阙，隙地富园林。\n天风下修竹，锵锵韵玉琴。\n浮觞清沼曲，憩石碧梧阴。\n别有闻佳咏，因之仰素心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1967,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贫乐堂","author":"杨士奇","text":"草色荫松门，青山绿树村。\n种蔬成小圃，饮水必澄源。\n每究贤人乐，时同静者论。\n穷通自有分，非为薄华轩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1968,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观海生诗为临海令作","author":"杨士奇","text":"作县临东海，当年眺览中。\n水云连浩渺，心境合昭融。\n已惬观澜趣，还思作楫功。\n有才终利涉，非比望洋同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1969,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高巨川挽诗","author":"杨士奇","text":"保障临江曲，荒城已半隳。\n重寻耆旧传，愁说乱离时。\n乡里思遗德，河山识令仪。\n孤坟三尺在，落日有馀悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1970,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"善乐堂","author":"杨士奇","text":"家惟经籍富，数世坐丘园。\n善乐承先训，心清味道言。\n穿林无曲径，引水得澄源。\n旦暮悠然处，南山正对门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1971,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题贝教谕容与轩","author":"杨士奇","text":"金川带玉笥，此地托幽轩。\n旦暮无尘事，弦歌近县门。\n傍花晴散帙，延月夜开樽。\n容与存吾道，长令学者尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1972,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送舒有常知县赴永春","author":"杨士奇","text":"幸际文明世，谁甘畎亩民。\n再来趋北阙，九月赴南闽。\n红树吴门郭，青帘海上津。\n有才当抚字，卓鲁亦何人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1973,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠魏将军","author":"杨士奇","text":"铁马载雕弓，身轻百战中。\n圣朝初偃武，高爵竟论功。\n带镂银花白，衣裁绣锦红。\n西清五云下，长卫大明宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1974,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高邮","author":"杨士奇","text":"四顾无山色，苍茫极远天。\n水云涵郡郭，粳稻被湖田。\n草舍津头市，菱歌柳外船。\n羁愁念前路，非为别离牵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1975,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过武城县","author":"杨士奇","text":"河上皆民舍，波光映苇扉。\n青裙沽酒过，白发载鲜归。\n仓廪丰年积，弦歌古俗稀。\n征帆未可住，还逐暮云飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1976,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"任丘道中","author":"杨士奇","text":"霜柳未全稀，风沙不住飞。\n居人过驿尽，猎火隔河微。\n客路冲寒景，天恩恋禁闱。\n金台行渐远，回首思依依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1977,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚次景州遇李颀给事吕文质进士","author":"杨士奇","text":"下马郭西村，萧条尽掩门。\n荒城明落景，独树出平原。\n野水条侯墓，寒芜董氏园。\n閒因访遗事，邂逅故人论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1978,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重过济宁","author":"杨士奇","text":"闾井皆临闸，郊原四望平。\n横峰连岱岳，分水向彭城。\n笳鼓屯千骑，舟车会两京。\n沿洄未能住，俱是重王程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1979,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽卢侍郎 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"三十趋京国，同时复有谁。\n贵为祈父佐，长在缙云司。\n物化嗟何速，神游不可知。\n凄凉山浦侧，千古葬灵輀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1980,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽卢侍郎 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"无复相逢处，相思每独哀。\n真成雕鹗奋，忽殒栋梁材。\n草露晞还落，河流去或回。\n空馀一片月，夜夜照中台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1981,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张鸣玉赣州知府","author":"杨士奇","text":"北阙捧恩荣，西江戒驿程。\n悠悠驱五马，冉冉度双旌。\n政得虔人爱，心如赣水清。\n崆峒千丈碧，应勒使君名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1982,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早度清流关","author":"杨士奇","text":"地险雄江北，崩云乱石高。\n古人成败远，行客往来劳。\n雾壑疑藏豹，风林讶啸猱。\n五年重过此，霜点旧青袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1983,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧知州清省居 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"白发滦州守，邦畿久著称。\n心清何所似，皎洁玉壶冰。\n数米功难致，烹鲜道可凭。\n从知清净理，未愧古人能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1984,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧知州清省居 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"廨宇清如水，时平案牍稀。\n阶前幽鸟下，帘外白云飞。\n易简民从化，廉平吏息机。\n鸣琴过日夕，玩月澹忘归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1985,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"非所寄示康甥荣","author":"杨士奇","text":"旦暮圜扉下，清羸念尔身。\n闭门堪避俗，省事足怡神。\n药里时常检，书灯夜少亲。\n亦知相念切，来问勿频频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1986,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘士皆云林小画","author":"杨士奇","text":"春雾晓初收，春山翠欲流。\n林霏疑雨润，岚彩近天浮。\n故里三华麓，当年一叶舟。\n看图浑彷佛，虚负水亭幽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1987,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月池彭母挽诗 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"七十人间世，婺居四十馀。\n冰霜明妇节，灯火课儿书。\n堂掩春晖暗，乌啼夜月虚。\n白头游子泪，和血洒衣裾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1988,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月池彭母挽诗 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"谁不为孀妇，风霜苦自持。\n人情易衰薄，亲戚厌□婺。\n旧箧藏遗简，寒机理断丝。\n百年池上月，曾照育孤时。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1989,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题杨学士画 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"群山开奕奕，清涧绕沄沄。\n叆叇疑浮玉，巑岏讶染纁。\n岩芝香可茹，林翠暖如熏。\n想见幽栖者，尘喧了不闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1990,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题杨学士画 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"素琴兼白鹤，潇洒散高踪。\n境类金精迥，山如玉笥重。\n泉香流石乳，霞彩拂虬松。\n溪上桃花满，神仙倘解逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1991,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜两坏壁简邻居诸君子","author":"杨士奇","text":"雨深颓屋壁，夜起揽衣趋。\n入室风翻幔，缘阶水倒渠。\n未沈爨下釜，急护案头书。\n得似东西舍，高眠总晏如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1992,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘编修朝宗赴九江教授 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"昔过浔阳郡，凭高畅客情。\n庐山当近郭，江水带孤城。\n茅屋家家净，渔舟个个轻。\n广文怀散逸，此去课诸生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1993,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘编修朝宗赴九江教授 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"去上还乡路，天恩便养亲。\n拜辞金殿直，谢别玉堂人。\n山水濂溪近，风烟栗里邻。\n怀贤知有志，应不负青春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1994,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行天寿山","author":"杨士奇","text":"连骑去骎骎，缘冈复度林。\n杏花明似绣，杨柳淡含金。\n万物亨嘉日，先朝种植心。\n白头供俸在，俯仰一沾襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1995,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓起","author":"杨士奇","text":"晓起侵风露，黄埃涌素袍。\n如林行队伍，缘涧耀旗旄。\n细马驰能捷，苍鹰奋欲高。\n从臣稀奏赋，心切圣躬劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1996,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行营夜雨","author":"杨士奇","text":"雨来从薄暮，沾洒夜将阑。\n稍喜尘埃息，何由衾席乾。\n天心存发育，人事有忧欢。\n森立戈殳士，通宵念尔难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1997,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早行","author":"杨士奇","text":"联骑载旌㫋，移营乱垄田。\n人行风露下，月转斗牛边。\n涉涧泥沾袂，穿林草没鞯。\n数家茅屋小，彷佛见炊烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1998,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冲雨","author":"杨士奇","text":"晨起冲寒雨，艰难念仆夫。\n山田行沮洳，石径度崎岖。\n矫矫虞张弋，桓桓士执殳。\n肩舆扶老病，扈跸愧残躯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1999,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵黄少保过田家有感","author":"杨士奇","text":"水旱农艰食，兹乡实可嗟。\n扫田纷拾稗，为饭杂蒸沙。\n岁赋徵仍急，秋成望苦赊。\n吾徒何补益，肉食老京华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2000,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚度密云北山绝顶","author":"杨士奇","text":"常奉垂堂戒，其如扈跸何。\n高疑登玉垒，近恐逼银河。\n宛转扪萝上，低回避石过。\n前途看渐晚，力尽敢蹉跎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2001,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送周布政之官三山","author":"杨士奇","text":"御苑柳初春，龙河冰始泮。\n祗命辞彤闱，驱车候清旦。\n超遥起云翼，光华升玉瓒。\n远别期誉名，无为乖阙叹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2002,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅花图","author":"杨士奇","text":"昔者江南住，栖迟万玉林。\n只今图画见，遗恨别离深。\n凛凛岁寒意，娟娟冰雪心。\n北人知爱少，閒伴小窗吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2003,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送袁文理 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"昔我艰虞日，于君邂逅欢。\n相看羡玉树，遂拟托金兰。\n岁月分携久，江湖聚晤难。\n喜闻嘉政满，荐剡出台端。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2004,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送袁文理 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"入觐初相见，升除遽不留。\n还寻江左路，问买浙西舟。\n桑梓归应蚤，莼鲈到及秋。\n伫闻宽恤治，为解别离愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2005,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄尤文度 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"三年别帝京，归卧阖闾城。\n贫病疏朋友，艰难倚弟兄。\n香焚瓦鼎细，寒拥纸屏清。\n自有床头易，时时畅道情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2006,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄黄宗豫少保","author":"杨士奇","text":"佩玉娱亲日，衣抛五色文。\n身閒疏药裹，庭静对炉熏。\n醉写泉头竹，吟看海上云。\n从知萧散地，一饭不忘君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2007,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邹谦所孝思堂","author":"杨士奇","text":"墓筑芜湖县，因之托数椽。\n却思严谴日，感泣更生年。\n十口今谁在，孤身秪自怜。\n朝朝松柏地，拜跽荐寒泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2008,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早发","author":"杨士奇","text":"行营侵曙发，风露不胜清。\n海色微茫动，林霏杳霭生。\n六军严虎卫，万骑翼霓旌。\n七九流年外，含毫扈远征。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2009,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观猎","author":"杨士奇","text":"扬旌表四岑，环戟拥如林。\n已失千寻险，宁遗三穴深。\n春蒐元有典，时育亦关心。\n解网商王德，光辉尚至今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2010,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早入蓟州","author":"杨士奇","text":"极目平无际，青山画不如。\n彩云迎霁旭，翠柳带澄渠。\n地重城逾壮，年丰廪有馀。\n未应两岐咏，独系汉人书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2011,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]